.TH ceam-util-system-fs 1  "fs " 
.SH NAME
ceam\-util\-system\-fs \- OverlayFS managements
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBceam\-util system fs\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
OverlayFS managements
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ceam\-util\-system\-fs\-readonly(1)
Switch the root filesystem to read\-only mode (OverlayFS)
.TP
ceam\-util\-system\-fs\-readwrite(1)
Switch the root filesystem back to read\-write mode
